node_modules/
dist/

# spy-state.json/spy-trades.jsonl (paper) and live-state.json/
# live-trades.jsonl (real account) are INTENTIONALLY tracked: they're
# committed back by their respective workflows after each session, the
# only persistence across ephemeral Actions runners. Real trade records
# being public was an explicit user choice (2026-10-16) — the credentials
# that could place new trades are what stay secret (.env, both token
# files above), not the historical record of what already happened.
